    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can Slip the Skin to partially assume a selkie form for 1 minute:</p><ul><li>You have Advantage on Dexterity saving throws.</li><li>Opportunity attacks against you are made with Disadvantage.</li><li>You can move through Enemy spaces without treating them as Difficult Terrain. You can use Slip the Skin a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</li></ul><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.304b6560ae093141]{Slip the Skin}</li></ul>"
